WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.088
Who owns this?

2
00:00:01.088 --> 00:00:07.011
Developers who own the clients, the identity
engineers who own the SailPoint side,

3
00:00:07.011 --> 00:00:09.712
and the I S S O who approves API clients.

4
00:00:09.712 --> 00:00:12.088
There are three non-person
identities here.

5
00:00:12.088 --> 00:00:15.950
A standing SailPoint reader
with exactly two read scopes.

6
00:00:15.950 --> 00:00:18.435
A workflow client with one manage scope,

7
00:00:18.435 --> 00:00:21.975
used once to create the three
workflows and then removed.

8
00:00:21.975 --> 00:00:25.544
And a Graph app registration
with the user read permission,

9
00:00:25.544 --> 00:00:30.480
plus the audit permission only if you read
the audit, signed in with a certificate.
